## Quoted material

Statutory text from Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 and Directive (EU) 2022/2557 is
reproduced from EUR-Lex. Reuse of Commission documents is governed by Decision
2011/833/EU. The EUR-Lex consolidated text carries the notice that it "is meant
purely as a documentation tool and has no legal effect"; the authentic version is
the Official Journal publication.

Quotations from third-party accounts are short extracts reproduced for analysis and
criticism, each attributed and linked at the point of use in `data/sources.yaml`.

## The model instrument

`instrument/model-article-91-request.md` is a **draft**. It has not been issued by,
adopted by, or submitted to the European Commission, the AI Office, or any other
Union body, and no Union body was consulted in its preparation. Fields requiring an
issuing authority are left as explicit placeholders. It must not be presented,
circulated, or adapted in any way that suggests it is an issued instrument.
